<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπελπίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buoy up with hope,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοὺς θειάσαντες ἐπήλπισαν, ὡς
					λήψονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πυθαγόρας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				44.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινί</span>”
				<i>pin one's hopes upon, hope in,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					41.11
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; but also, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			merely, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1011
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.74
			</span></i>, al.; <i>hope besides,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.54
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίζων</span>
			).</div>
